msgid ""
"The width in pixels of a border around the edge\n"
"of the cover. Specify 0 for no border"
msgstr ""
"表紙の外周に引く境界線の幅 (ピクセル単位)。\n"
"境界線なしの場合は 0 を指定します"

#: dialogs.py:1314
msgid "Image border:"
msgstr "画像の境界線:"

#: dialogs.py:1315
msgid ""
"The width in pixels of a border around the edge\n"
"of the image. Specify 0 for no border"
msgstr ""
"画像の外周に引く境界線の幅 (ピクセル単位)。\n"
"境界線なしの場合は 0 を指定します"

#: dialogs.py:1354
msgid "Field Order:"
